      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A pattern popularized by Meituan's \"Leaf\" service and commonly asked as a follow-up to \"what if you don't want timestamp-encoded IDs at all, just opaque sequential integers?\"",
