      "text": "Messages exceeding max retries land in a DLQ topic, monitored by automated alerting (a\nsustained rise in DLQ volume for one provider is often the earliest signal of a provider outage —\nearlier than the provider's own status page).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Messages exceeding max retries land in a DLQ topic, monitored by automated alerting (a sustained rise in DLQ volume for one provider is often the earliest signal of a provider outage — earlier than the provider's own status page).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
